OL,4,CJudge finds Thomas Markle mentally fit 
OL,5,Cto stand trial on child abuse charges  
OL,6,GA judge in Florida has declared Thomas 
OL,7,GMarkle Sr, the father of Meghan,       
OL,8,GDuchess of Sussex, to be mentally      
OL,9,Gcompetent to stand trial for           
OL,10,Gpossessing indecent images of children.
OL,12,FThe hearing came after an evaluation   
OL,13,Fby a court-appointed psychiatrist      
OL,14,Fconducted on Prince Harry's 82-year-   
OL,15,Fold father-in-law.                     
OL,17,FMarkle, who has denied possessing      
OL,18,Fimages of child sex abuse, was ordered 
OL,19,Fto stay in jail pending trial earlier  
OL,20,Fthis month after allegedly removing a  
OL,21,Flocation monitoring device.            
